WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.209
Mole lay on the riverbank.

2
00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:22.495
Rat was away visiting Otter.

3
00:00:22.496 --> 00:00:27.270
"Oh, why didn't I go with Rat?" said Mole.

4
00:00:27.271 --> 00:00:31.601
"He's late, and now the sun is setting."

5
00:00:31.602 --> 00:00:36.201
At last Mole heard Rat's footsteps.

6
00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.487
Rat sat down beside him.

7
00:00:38.488 --> 00:00:42.405
"Why did you stay so long?" asked Mole.

8
00:00:42.406 --> 00:00:44.897
"I had to," said Rat.

9
00:00:44.898 --> 00:00:47.205
"Otter is in trouble."

10
00:00:47.206 --> 00:00:49.818
"What is it?" asked Mole.

11
00:00:49.819 --> 00:00:53.814
"Otter's son, Little Portly," said Rat.

12
00:00:53.815 --> 00:00:56.471
"He's missing again."

13
00:00:56.472 --> 00:01:01.449
"Oh, Portly is always running off," said Mole.

14
00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:04.336
"I know," said Rat.

15
00:01:04.337 --> 00:01:08.123
"And he always comes back," said Mole.

16
00:01:08.124 --> 00:01:12.800
"But Portly has been missing for days," said Rat.

17
00:01:12.801 --> 00:01:17.144
Mole listened closely to Rat's news.

18
00:01:17.145 --> 00:01:20.277
"Otter looked everywhere," said Rat.

19
00:01:20.278 --> 00:01:23.003
"He asked every animal.

20
00:01:23.004 --> 00:01:26.407
No one saw Little Portly anywhere."

21
00:01:26.408 --> 00:01:30.204
"What will Otter do?" asked Mole.

22
00:01:30.205 --> 00:01:34.080
"Otter goes to the old bridge," said Rat.

23
00:01:34.081 --> 00:01:37.224
"He taught Portly to swim there.

24
00:01:37.225 --> 00:01:40.570
Portly caught his first fish there too."

25
00:01:40.571 --> 00:01:45.339
"It's a place Portly remembers," said Mole.

26
00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:50.009
"Yes, Portly loves the old bridge," said Rat.

27
00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:53.006
"Otter waits there every night."

28
00:01:53.007 --> 00:01:59.403
Rat and Mole sat quietly for a while.

29
00:01:59.404 --> 00:02:03.401
They both imagined Otter at the bridge.

30
00:02:03.402 --> 00:02:07.478
They thought of him worrying all night.

31
00:02:07.479 --> 00:02:13.011
"Rat," said Mole, "we just can't go to bed."

32
00:02:13.012 --> 00:02:16.116
"I agree," said Rat.

33
00:02:16.117 --> 00:02:20.296
"Let's find Portly."
